CAMCRAFT_ROTOR_STEP it prints that it skipped and returns, on every
system. The per-parse progress and per-stage/per-attempt timing lines
are tracing::debug! now; the bench sets its own camcraft_kernel=debug
filter and still prints them. The stage key of the progress guard is
the stage name, not its length. The Cargo.toml comment names #4200
beside #163.

